title: mf log redo
tags: [[CLI command]] [[Event log]]
kind: reference
summary: Take back the undos of a label of the newest undo still standing (none named: list them)

Without a label, lists the labels the newest undo still standing was written in, and writes nothing; with one, reverts its undos still standing; `plan <label>` previews it ([[Undo and redo]]).
